<div class="container py-4">
  <h1 class="h4 mb-2">Toggle switches</h1>
  <p class="text-muted small mb-4">
    Markup: <code>.form-check.form-switch</code> wrapping a checkbox <code>input.form-check-input</code> + <code>label.form-check-label</code>.
    The shared partial <code>app/views/shared/_check_box.html.haml</code> applies <code>control_col: 'form-switch …'</code> and <code>check_box_class: 'form-check-input'</code> — same pattern as v1.
    Visual theme (track, thumb SVGs, focus) is aligned with v1 <code>bootstrap_and_overrides</code> via <code>v2/_form_checks_range.scss</code>.
  </p>

  <div class="form-check form-switch mb-3">
    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="ds-sw1" checked>
    <label class="form-check-label" for="ds-sw1">Enabled by default</label>
  </div>

  <div class="form-check form-switch mb-3">
    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="ds-sw2">
    <label class="form-check-label" for="ds-sw2">Off</label>
  </div>

  <div class="form-check form-switch mb-0">
    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="ds-sw3" disabled>
    <label class="form-check-label" for="ds-sw3">Disabled switch</label>
  </div>
</div>
